  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING: The internal virtual methods of the HostRunner are now taking the options callback as well.\n- BREAKING: AutoRegisterDefaultServices is now true by default.\n- BREAKING: The options method AddMandatoryServices() now needs the runner instance to be passed to it.\n- BuildHost() can be overridden in runner.\n- OpenTelemetry is now configured here and can be disabled with new option.\n- Runner has new overrides for OnInternalOpenTelemetryConfiguration, OnInternalOpenTelemetryTracingConfiguration and OnInternalOpenTelemetryMeterConfiguration\n- A new callback AfterAppConfigurationConfigured in the options allows to hook into the App Configuration options.\n- Virtual was removed from all option props.\n- GetCredential is now public",
